      },
      {
        "answer": "No, it doesn't trigger.  After this card's [Main] effect gives \"[End of Your Turn] Delete 1 of your Digimon\" to a Digimon, then it triggers, that Digimon's player will be the player considered to have triggered/activated that effect, therefore <Partition> won't trigger.",
